- Timing / additional adjustments: Annual Report includes share-based compensation as an add-back in 2020 (34,711), whereas some prospectus LTM tables show share option program cost as "-" (nil) — may reflect timing or how share option costs were treated in interim reporting vs annual consolidated statements. The Prospectus LTM table still shows share option program cost as "-" but the Prospectus definition included share option program costs. The Annual Report clarifies share-based compensation included in adjustments for 2020.
